---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About | Tanishk Tiwari"
  description="About Tanishk Tiwari — undergraduate AI researcher at DSEU working on efficient LLM inference, mechanistic interpretability, and computational epigraphy."
>
  <div class="shell section">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="section-num">ABOUT</span>
        <h1 class="display-lg">The person behind the <span class="serif text-acid">work.</span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_340px]">
      <div class="space-y-6 text-[0.98rem] text-dim leading-relaxed reveal">
        <p class="text-bone text-lg leading-relaxed">
          I'm Tanishk Tiwari, an undergraduate researcher pursuing a B.Tech in Artificial Intelligence and Machine
          Learning at <strong class="text-bone font-medium">Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University</strong> in
          New Delhi (expected 2028).
        </p>

        <p>
          My work sits at the intersection of systems efficiency and sequence structure. I like problems where the
          bottleneck is concrete — memory, latency, gradient signal, or statistical evidence — and where careful
          measurement matters more than hype.
        </p>

        <div class="panel p-6 my-8">
          <p class="label label-acid mb-4">Research threads</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-acid text-xs mt-1">01</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-bone font-medium">Efficient LLM inference &amp; KV-cache compression</p>
                <p class="mt-1">Value-focused compaction, adaptive low-rank representations, salient residual preservation, and compressed attention for long-context autoregressive inference.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-acid text-xs mt-1">02</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-bone font-medium">Mechanistic interpretability of open-weight LLMs</p>
                <p class="mt-1">Forward hooks, residual-stream activations, attention-head specialisation, and activation patching on Qwen models.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex gap-4">
              <span class="font-mono text-acid text-xs mt-1">03</span>
              <div>
                <p class="text-bone font-medium">Computational &amp; statistical epigraphy</p>
                <p class="mt-1">A harmonised corpus of 6,000+ Indus inscriptions studied through conditional entropy, PMI, positional regularity, HMMs, BiLSTM prediction, and perturbation controls.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <p>
          My paper <em class="text-bone serif not-italic font-normal">“Statistical Structure in Indus Sign Sequences”</em>
          was published in the <strong class="text-bone font-medium">Proceedings of NLP4DH 2026</strong> (co-located with
          <strong class="text-bone font-medium">ACL 2026</strong>) and presented in person in San Diego, CA.
        </p>

        <p>
          Beyond this, I conduct exploratory experiments in <strong class="text-bone font-medium">Quantum Machine Learning</strong>,
          measuring gradient variance and barren-plateau behaviour in mixed-state PennyLane setups with amplitude damping and
          non-unitary operations.
        </p>

        <p>
          I care about work that is reproducible, measurable, and intellectually honest — whether that means benchmarking
          a compression scheme against perplexity or refusing to overclaim structure in an undeciphered script.
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="space-y-5 reveal">
        <div class="panel p-6">
          <p class="label label-acid mb-4">Education</p>
          <p class="font-semibold text-bone">B.Tech, Artificial Intelligence &amp; Machine Learning</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-dim mt-1">Delhi Skill and Entrepreneurship University</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-dim">New Delhi, India · Expected 2028</p>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-line text-sm">
            <p class="text-dim"><span class="text-bone font-medium">CGPA:</span> 8.2 / 10</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-line">
            <p class="label mb-2">Coursework</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-dim">Data Structures &amp; Algorithms, Probability &amp; Statistics, Optimization, Machine Learning, Discrete Mathematics.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="panel p-6">
          <p class="label label-acid mb-4">Recognition</p>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-dim">
            <li>
              <p class="text-bone font-medium">EACL 2026 SRW Mentorship</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5">Selected for the pre-submission mentorship programme.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p class="text-bone font-medium">NLP4DH / ACL 2026 Presenter</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5">Presented in person in San Diego, USA.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p class="text-bone font-medium">Invited Lecture, RMRL Chennai</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5">“Reading the Indus Anew”, 2025.</p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="panel p-6">
          <p class="label mb-4">Elsewhere</p>
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            <a href="https://github.com/horus84" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">GitHub ↗</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/Tanishk-Tiwari-2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">LinkedIn ↗</a>
            <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0004-6482-4479" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">ORCID ↗</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
